{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://sentinel-arena.local/schemas/verdict.schema.json",
  "title": "Blue verdict (contract 4, schema_version 0.4)",
  "description": "One line of data/runs/<match_id>/verdicts.jsonl, exactly one per judged proxy line (Stage 5.4 on). Written by Blue from the proxy log alone. 'log_seq' is Blue's own 1-based index into the proxy log, NOT the round. Either a verdict (verdict + source) or the reason there is none (no_verdict_reason + failure_detail). no_verdict: the brain produced no usable answer (a miss on attacks). instrument_failure: the harness failed (body refusal or API failure after retries, D13); the Judge cross-checks it against api_calls.jsonl and excludes it from detection and FP stats. failure_detail is audit-only: the Judge reads only no_verdict_reason. 'reason' and 'rationale' are for humans only.  Stage 5.5 (0.3): source gains 'rule' (a hot-loaded rule fired, D9: no API call was made for the line), and fired_rule_ids (required) lists every rule that fired, in hot-load order; non-empty iff source is 'rule'. A rule verdict has no rationale. Written by claude Blue with rule invention in mode 'shadow' or 'on'; scripted Blue and mode 'off' keep writing 0.2. Stage 6.1 (0.4, D22): written by claude Blue in rules mode 'on' when a rule library is loaded (D21; without a library mode on keeps writing 0.3). fired_rule_ids may mix library ids (lib-NNNN, preloaded, always listed first) and in-match ids (r-NNN). rule_origin (required) names where the tie-break winner came from: 'library' or 'match'; non-null iff source is 'rule'. source is unchanged: a library rule and an in-match rule are the same mechanism (rule engine, no API call). 0.3 / 0.2 / 0.1 verdicts are validated by verdict_v0_3 / verdict_v0_2 / verdict_v0_1.schema.json.",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "schema_version",
    "match_id",
    "log_seq",
    "request_id",
    "verdict",
    "source",
    "no_verdict_reason",
    "failure_detail",
    "fired_rule_ids",
    "rule_origin",
    "reason"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
      "const": "0.4"
    },
    "match_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^(m[0-9]{3,}|[0-9]{8}T[0-9]{6}Z-[0-9a-f]{4})$"
    },
    "log_seq": {
      "type": "integer",
      "minimum": 1
    },
    "request_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-4[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$"
    },
    "verdict": {
      "enum": [
        "CWE-89",
        "CWE-79",
        "CWE-22",
        "benign",
        "other",
        null
      ]
    },
    "source": {
      "enum": [
        "signature",
        "ai",
        "rule",
        null
      ]
    },
    "no_verdict_reason": {
      "enum": [
        null,
        "no_verdict",
        "instrument_failure"
      ]
    },
    "failure_detail": {
      "enum": [
        null,
        "invalid_json",
        "invalid_shape",
        "missing_index",
        "duplicate_index",
        "unknown_index",
        "unknown_label",
        "model_refusal",
        "max_tokens",
        "refused_by_body",
        "api_error"
      ]
    },
    "fired_rule_ids": {
      "type": "array",
      "uniqueItems": true,
      "items": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^(r-[0-9]{3,}|lib-[0-9]{4,})$"
      }
    },
    "rule_origin": {
      "enum": [
        "library",
        "match",
        null
      ]
    },
    "rationale": {
      "type": "string",
      "maxLength": 200
    },
    "reason": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "technique": {
      "type": [
        "string",
        "null"
      ],
      "maxLength": 64,
      "description": "Open Blue (D42, replay-only) only: a short technique string, present with the `other` verdict. Absent otherwise."
    }
  },
  "allOf": [
    {
      "comment": "a verdict carries its source and no reason; no verdict carries a reason and a detail",
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "verdict": {
            "type": "null"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "source": {
            "const": null
          },
          "no_verdict_reason": {
            "enum": [
              "no_verdict",
              "instrument_failure"
            ]
          },
          "failure_detail": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "not": {
          "required": [
            "rationale"
          ]
        }
      },
      "else": {
        "properties": {
          "source": {
            "enum": [
              "signature",
              "ai",
              "rule"
            ]
          },
          "no_verdict_reason": {
            "const": null
          },
          "failure_detail": {
            "const": null
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "comment": "failure_detail belongs to its reason",
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "no_verdict_reason": {
            "const": "no_verdict"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "failure_detail": {
            "enum": [
              "invalid_json",
              "invalid_shape",
              "missing_index",
              "duplicate_index",
              "unknown_index",
              "unknown_label",
              "model_refusal",
              "max_tokens"
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "no_verdict_reason": {
            "const": "instrument_failure"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "failure_detail": {
            "enum": [
              "refused_by_body",
              "api_error"
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "comment": "a signature verdict has no rationale",
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "source": {
            "const": "signature"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "not": {
          "required": [
            "rationale"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "comment": "a rule verdict lists the rules that fired and has no rationale; every other row lists none",
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "source": {
            "const": "rule"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "source"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "fired_rule_ids": {
            "minItems": 1
          }
        },
        "not": {
          "required": [
            "rationale"
          ]
        }
      },
      "else": {
        "properties": {
          "fired_rule_ids": {
            "maxItems": 0
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "comment": "rule_origin is set iff the verdict came from a rule; it names the tie-break winner (library rules precede in-match rules, so a 'match' winner means no library rule fired)",
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "source": {
            "const": "rule"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "source"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "rule_origin": {
            "enum": [
              "library",
              "match"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "else": {
        "properties": {
          "rule_origin": {
            "const": null
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "rule_origin": {
            "const": "library"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "rule_origin"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "fired_rule_ids": {
            "prefixItems": [
              {
                "pattern": "^lib-[0-9]{4,}$"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "rule_origin": {
            "const": "match"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "rule_origin"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "fired_rule_ids": {
            "items": {
              "pattern": "^r-[0-9]{3,}$"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
